(a)	the following paragraph 1a is inserted:
‘1a. The competent authority may decrease the amount of the penalty calculated in accordance with paragraph 1, considering one or more of the following factors:
a) the extent of unreported information;
b) the level of cooperation and readiness of the authorised CBAM declarant to comply with requests for information;
c) the unintentional nature of the behaviour of the authorised CBAM declarant;
d) the past compliance of the authorised CBAM declarant.;’
